After the job ﬁnishes, you can use the standard _search API to search the target index.
For example, after running a transform job that transforms the ﬂight data based on the
DestAirportID ﬁeld, you can run the following request to return all ﬁelds that have a value of
SFO:
GET target_index/_search
{
"query": {
"match": {
"DestAirportID_terms" : "SFO"
}
}
}
